# Firebase Staging Deploy Guidance

When the user asks how to deploy a staging version, test changes before production, or create a temporary test website for this repo, default to recommending a Firebase Hosting preview channel.

Use this repo-specific command sequence:

```bash
npm run build
firebase hosting:channel:deploy staging --expires 7d
```

Explain that this creates a temporary preview URL for testing before deploying to the live site, and that it is sufficient for feature testing in this project.

Only recommend a separate Firebase project or permanent staging site if the user explicitly asks for a long-lived, isolated staging environment.
